{"id": "19-616-2-5", "zh": "167. Najjā yosvāma（nadī 之后，yo 可加 āma）", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-617-2-7", "zh": "在 yo 之前，nadī 一词可以加 āma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-617-8-20", "zh": "suña、naka、āma 等中的 ñ、k、m 字母，是增音的标志。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-617-21-41", "zh": "依“带 m 标志者置于诸元音中最后一个之后”这条规则，āma 带有 m 标志，所以置于诸元音中最后一个之后，也就是置于 ī 字母之后。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-617-42-58", "zh": "依“yavā sare”，在 y 之前 d 变为 j，y 又同化为前一个音，得到 najjāyo。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-617-59-67", "zh": "在不加 āma 的情形下，经 pa 音脱落与 yo 脱落，得到 najjo、nadī、nadiyo 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-618-2-3", "zh": "以上是以 ī 结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-619-2-6", "zh": "主格：单数 yāgu，复数 yāgū、yāguyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-619-7-12", "zh": "呼格：单数 bho yāgu，复数 yāgū、yāguyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-619-13-17", "zh": "宾格：单数 yāguṃ，复数 yāgū、yāguyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-619-18-22", "zh": "具格、从格：单数 yāguyā，复数 yāgūhi、yāgūbhi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-619-23-26", "zh": "与格、属格：单数 yāguyā，复数 yāgūnaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-619-27-31", "zh": "处格：单数 yāguyaṃ、yāguyā，复数 yāgūsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-619-32-54", "zh": "dhātu、dhenu、kāsu、daddu、kaṇḍu、kacchu、rajju、kareṇu、sassu、piyaṅgu 等词也是这样变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-620-2-19", "zh": "这里，dhātu 一词因为《入阿毗达摩论》中说了“manodhātunā”，所以也见于阳性；有人说，那是依梵语的观点说的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-621-2-5", "zh": "主格：单数 mātā，复数 mātaro。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-621-6-11", "zh": "呼格：单数 bho māta、mātā，复数 mātaro。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-621-12-16", "zh": "宾格：单数 mātaraṃ，复数 mātare、mātaro。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-621-17-42", "zh": "具格：单数 mātarā；nā 变为 yā 时，依“ye passā”这条规则的拆分，pa 音脱落，如“anuññāto ahaṃ matyā”（我已得到母亲的允许）；又如“aññatra mātuyā”（除了母亲）；复数 mātarehi、mātarebhi、mātūhi、mātūbhi。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-621-43-59", "zh": "与格、属格：sa 脱落时为 mātu；因为它有 pa 的名称，所以不变为 no；又有 matyā、mātuyā；复数 mātarānaṃ、mātānaṃ、mātūnaṃ。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-621-60-69", "zh": "在第六格的用法中，也见到“mātussa saratī”（忆念母亲）这样的形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-621-70-74", "zh": "处格：单数 mātari，复数 mātaresu、mātūsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-621-75-79", "zh": "除了这些特殊之处以外，与 pitu 一词相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-621-80-84", "zh": "dhītu、duhitu 两个词也是这样变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-622-2-3", "zh": "以上是以 u 结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-623-2-7", "zh": "禁止变短元音，并使 si 脱落之后，得到 jambū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-623-8-18", "zh": "依“jantvā”等规则使 yo 脱落，得到复数 jambū；另有 jambuyo。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-623-19-32", "zh": "依“ge vā”变为短元音，呼格单数得 bho jambu，复数 jambū、jambuyo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-623-33-37", "zh": "宾格：单数 jambuṃ，复数 jambū、jambuyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-623-38-42", "zh": "具格、从格：单数 jambuyā，复数 jambūhi、jambūbhi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-623-43-46", "zh": "与格、属格：单数 jambuyā，复数 jambūnaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-623-47-51", "zh": "处格：单数 jambuyaṃ、jambuyā，复数 jambūsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-624-2-10", "zh": "同样，vadhū、sarabhū、sarabū、sutanū、camū，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-625-2-8", "zh": "以及 vāmūrū、nāganāsūrū，确实都与 jambū 相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-626-2-3", "zh": "以上是以 ū 结尾的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-627-2-8", "zh": "go：go，复数 gāvo、gavo 等，与阳性相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-628-2-3", "zh": "以上是阴性词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-629-2-6", "zh": "napuṃsaka 加 si——", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-630-2-5", "zh": "111. Aṃ napuṃsake（在中性中变为 aṃ）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-631-2-8", "zh": "在中性中，以 a 结尾的名词之后，si 变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-631-9-10", "zh": "得到 napuṃsakaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-632-2-5", "zh": "112. Yonaṃ ni（yo 变为 ni）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-633-2-7", "zh": "在中性中，以 a 结尾的名词之后，yo 变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-633-8-24", "zh": "ni 虽然是必然规定，但依“ninaṃ vā”，在另一种情形下变为 ṭā、ṭe；元音延长后，得到 napuṃsakā、napuṃsakāni。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-633-25-31", "zh": "呼格：单数 bho napuṃsaka、napuṃsakā，复数 napuṃsakā、napuṃsakāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-633-32-36", "zh": "宾格：单数 napuṃsakaṃ，复数 napuṃsake、napuṃsakāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-633-37-41", "zh": "具格 napuṃsakena 等，与 sugata 一词相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-633-42-43", "zh": "同样变化的有——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-634-2-11", "zh": "puñña、pāpa、phala、rūpa、sādhana，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-635-2-11", "zh": "sota、ghāna、sukha、dukkha、kāraṇa；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-636-2-11", "zh": "dāna、sīla、dhana、jhāna、locana，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-637-2-11", "zh": "mūla、kūla、bala、jāla、maṅgala。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-638-2-13", "zh": "naḷina、liṅga、mukha、aṅga、jala、ambuja，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-639-2-11", "zh": "pulina、dhañña、hirañña、phala、amata；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-640-2-11", "zh": "paduma、paṇṇa、susāna、vana、āyudha，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-641-2-11", "zh": "hadaya、cīvara、vattha、kula、indriya。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-642-2-13", "zh": "nayana、vadana、yāna、odana、sopāna、pāna，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-643-2-15", "zh": "bhavana、bhuvana、loha、alāta、tuṇḍa、aṇḍa、pīṭha，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-644-2-13", "zh": "karaṇa、maraṇa、ñāṇa、ārammaṇa、arañña、tāṇa，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-645-2-13", "zh": "tagara、nagara、tīra、chatta、chidda、udaka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-645-14-15", "zh": "等等；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-646-2-3", "zh": "主格：ekaccaṃ，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-647-2-7", "zh": "136. Na nissa ṭā（ni 不变为 ṭā）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-648-2-10", "zh": "在 ekacca 等词之后，ni 不变为 ṭā，得到 ekaccāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-648-11-16", "zh": "呼格：单数 bho ekacca，复数 ekaccā、ekaccāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-648-17-21", "zh": "宾格：单数 ekaccaṃ，复数 ekacce、ekaccāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-648-22-24", "zh": "其余与 napuṃsaka 相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-649-2-7", "zh": "paṭhama 也是这样变化：paṭhamaṃ、paṭhamāni 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-649-8-14", "zh": "pada：padaṃ，复数 padā、padāni 等，与 napuṃsaka 相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-649-15-17", "zh": "只在 nā 与 smiṃ 上有所不同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-650-2-5", "zh": "106. Nāssa sā（nā 变为 sā）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-651-2-7", "zh": "在 pada 等词之后，nā 可以变为 sā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-651-8-10", "zh": "具格：padasā、padena。", "confidence": 80}
